MODIFICATIONS
=============

Per Apache License 2.0 §4(b), the following states the changes made to the
original work. This repository tracks upstream TradingAgents (merged through
v0.5.0) and adds a data layer for Indian equities:

New files:
  tradingagents/dataflows/india_data_common.py   shared validation, throttling,
                                                 caching and look-ahead guards
  tradingagents/dataflows/nse_india.py           NSE: FII/DII flows, India VIX,
                                                 Nifty put-call ratio, promoter
                                                 shareholding, corporate actions,
                                                 exchange announcements
  tradingagents/dataflows/rbi_rates.py           RBI policy rates (repo, SDF,
                                                 MSF, bank rate, CRR, SLR)
  tradingagents/dataflows/screener_in.py         optional FII/DII ownership split
  tradingagents/dataflows/india_context.py       assembles the above into the
                                                 news and fundamentals prompts
  tradingagents/dataflows/india_news.py          Economic Times / Mint RSS vendor
  tradingagents/dataflows/india_universe.py      Nifty 50 ticker universe
  scripts/analyze_india_universe.py              batch runner
  scripts/verify_india_sources.py                live source cross-check
  scripts/build_report_dashboard.py              offline HTML report viewer

Modified files:
  tradingagents/agents/analysts/news_analyst.py          India market context
  tradingagents/agents/analysts/fundamentals_analyst.py  ownership context,
                                                         currency caveats
  tradingagents/agents/analysts/sentiment_analyst.py     regional subreddits
  tradingagents/agents/analysts/market_analyst.py        India VIX, configurable
                                                         indicator budget
  tradingagents/agents/utils/agent_utils.py              currency-mismatch guard
  tradingagents/dataflows/reddit.py                      India subreddit routing
  tradingagents/dataflows/stocktwits.py                  NSE/BSE symbol handling
  tradingagents/dataflows/fred.py                        India macro aliases,
                                                         staleness warnings
  tradingagents/dataflows/stockstats_utils.py            damaged-cache detection
  tradingagents/dataflows/utils.py                       '&' in NSE tickers
  tradingagents/dataflows/interface.py                   India news vendor
  tradingagents/graph/trading_graph.py                   regional news queries
  tradingagents/default_config.py                        India and free-tier
                                                         configuration
  README.md                                              documents the above

